~ stone_1

Unknown: Somebody went to the trouble of a headstone. The least I can do is read it. [ID:HINT_STONE_1]

=> END

~ stone_2

Unknown: That gravestone. There's lettering on it, what's left of it. [ID:HINT_STONE_2]

=> END

~ stone_3

Unknown: The gravestone, up close. The name, and the words under it. [ID:HINT_STONE_3]

=> END

~ cathedral_1

Unknown: The dead here won't tell me any more. Maybe the city will. [ID:HINT_CATHEDRAL_1]

=> END

~ cathedral_2

Unknown: The path runs east, toward that cathedral. [ID:HINT_CATHEDRAL_2]

=> END

~ cathedral_3

Unknown: East. Follow the path to the cathedral. [ID:HINT_CATHEDRAL_3]

=> END

~ statue_1

Unknown: Something in this place remembers more than I do. [ID:HINT_STATUE_1]

=> END

~ statue_2

Unknown: That saint by the wall. I keep wanting to reach for it. [ID:HINT_STATUE_2]

=> END

~ statue_3

Unknown: The statue. Put a hand on it. [ID:HINT_STATUE_3]

=> END

~ none

Unknown: Nothing pulls at me right now. The rest of me is still out there, somewhere. [ID:HINT_NONE_1]

=> END
